Subject: [PATCH] Reset default minimumchainwork and assumevalid for mainnet.
 (#205)

This will get nodes out of IBD immediately and allow mining without changing configs.

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: 8c4619f67ddbc27be79fb5381322f349eff81d7a
Recorded-replay-commit: 0635028f3a56cac47eba6de8170d2165309a667b

